meta {
  name: 05 Admin - GitHub proxy
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  Server-side GitHub lookups used by the project form. The GITHUB_TOKEN never
  leaves the server; if it is missing / expired the proxy falls back to
  unauthenticated calls (lower rate limit), so these still pass. Requires
  "00 Setup" and network access to api.github.com.
}
